From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UN1CA <noreply@unica.local>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Allow local SCPM allowlist packages

Samsung SCPM can overwrite AudioMirroring's private ALLOW_LIST with only
com.spotify.music. Keep the stock SCPM flow intact, but also accept exact
packages from Settings.System.unica_scpm_allowlist_packages at runtime.
